# =============================================================================
# AR_DPP — repository root
#
# MOVED 2026-07-30 from XR/AR_DPP_VCU up to AR_DPP, so the thesis artefacts
# (DPP_UI_Specs, LCA_Analysis, CAD_Specs, Docs) are versioned alongside the code.
#
# ⚠ EVERY root-anchored rule from the old .gitignore had to be re-anchored to
#   XR/AR_DPP_VCU/. A leading-slash pattern like "/Library/" matches only at the
#   repo root — after the move it silently stops matching, and Unity's Library/
#   is gigabytes. If you ever move the root again, redo this block first.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unity project — XR/AR_DPP_VCU
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/Library/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/Temp/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/Obj/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/Build/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/Builds/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/Logs/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/UserSettings/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/MemoryCaptures/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/Recordings/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/.vscode/
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/*_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/

# Build artefact + signing key — never publish the keystore
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/test.apk
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/user.keystore

# FastAPI virtualenv
XR/AR_DPP_VCU/backend/.venv/

# Unity regenerates these on open; they are pure noise in diffs
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties

# Player builds
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ARCHIVES — never version an archive. This caught us out on 2026-07-30:
# XR/AR_DPP_VCU.zip is a 3.34 GB full backup of the Unity project sitting beside
# the project folder, and it alone made a `git push` produce a 3.26 GiB pack that
# GitHub rejected with HTTP 500. Archives are snapshots; git already IS one.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.gz

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# openLCA / ecoinvent — LICENSED, must never leave this machine.
# LCA_Analysis/Database/ holds "Ecoinvent Database 3.8.zip" at 14.1 GB PLUS an
# extracted copy of it. This single rule is the difference between a 100 MB push
# and a ~30 GB one. Do not remove it.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zolca
LCA_Analysis/Database/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Monte Carlo raw exports — 7 files x ~29 MB = ~203 MB of regenerable openLCA
# output. The PARSED results (mc_summary.csv, mc_raw_*.csv, ~4 MB total) ARE
# tracked, and those are the authoritative numbers per the LCA framework, so
# nothing scientific is lost by leaving the workbooks out.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
LCA_Analysis/Outputs/4_monte_carlo/simulation_result_*.xlsx

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Creo standard-parts library — PTC ships this, it is not our work, and it is
# 81 MB of the 86 MB in CAD_Specs (119 .prt bearings + 94 .bmp thumbnails, none
# of it VCU-related). Third-party redistribution question, and regenerable from
# a Creo install. Our own CAD is the remaining ~5 MB and IS tracked.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
CAD_Specs/ANSI-Metric-*/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PARTICIPANT DATA — never publish. The BLANK consent form is fine to track;
# anything signed, filled in, or exported from the study is personal data under
# GDPR and SRH's data-protection rules. Backstop only — the real control is not
# putting these files in the working tree.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/Study_Data/
**/participants/
*_signed*
*_responses*.csv
*_responses*.xlsx

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Literature — excluded for copyright (see project memory: literature lives in
# OneDrive and must not reach GitHub). Rule kept here as a backstop in case a
# PDF is ever dropped into the working tree by accident.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
**/LITERATURE/
**/Literature/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Office / OS lock + temp files
# (a stale .~lock.VCU_BOM_v4.xlsx# already sits in LCA_Analysis)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
~$*
.~lock.*#
*.tmp
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
